  "slug": "banquet-order-sign-in-sheet-form",
  "title": "Banquet Order Sign-In Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "Assign banquet service staff to stations, sign them in and out, and record the pre-shift briefing and break coverage.",
  "description": "An original shift register for banquet service staff. It records the shift and staffing plan, each person's sign-in and sign-out with role and station, the station assignment map with backup and break cover, the break log, exceptions such as no-shows or uncovered stations, and an accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use at the start of a banquet shift when a captain must know who is on the floor, which station each person owns, and who covers a break. The register closes when every person has signed out and uncovered stations have been recorded.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
